              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yilowo nalowo ophumela ngaphandle kweminyango yendlu yakho, igazi lakhe liyakuba sekhanda lakhe, thina singabi nacala; noma ubani okini endlini, igazi lakhe malibe phezu kwekhanda lethu, uma kukhona isandla esiphezu kwakhe.",
